# Production deploy

Preferred: **Option B** in `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md` — `docker compose build app` on the laptop, `docker save` / `scp` / `docker load`, then `docker compose up -d --no-deps app`. Do not `docker compose down -v`.

SSH: `ssh -o BatchMode=yes cm-desk-prod -- …` only. Recreate app only; leave postgres/redis. Entrypoint runs `yarn migrate`—read new `drizzle/` files before shipping.

CI does not deploy. After recreate, `curl` `/api/health`. Report `MOCK_ORDERS` as a value; never print `.env` or queue names.
